        <mxCell id="notes" value="Wire color convention:&#10;red = battery +&#10;black = battery - / GND&#10;orange = regulated 5 V&#10;white = signal (I2C SDA)&#10;gray = I2C SCL&#10;green = FC TX to peripheral RX&#10;yellow = peripheral TX to FC RX&#10;&#10;Notes:&#10;- Twist every power pair; route motor phase wires away from GNSS and I2C.&#10;- Star ground at the PDB: no daisy-chained grounds.&#10;- XT60 is the rated bottleneck (60 A); never up-size fuses instead of wire." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1">
